    "introduction": "Legal & General provides retirement, insurance and investment services to individuals and institutions. Its activities include managing investment portfolios, offering annuities and taking on pension obligations from corporate pension schemes. Revenue and earnings arise from asset-management fees, insurance operations and returns generated while managing long-term liabilities. Customers rely on it for services that can extend over decades, so asset selection, capital strength and liability management are fundamental. The business is influenced by pension demand, market levels, interest rates and longevity assumptions. Its combination of investment expertise and retirement products connects the management of savings with the provision of future income.",
